{
  "about": "Shared boundary cases for the expected-discharge alert rule. IDENTICAL file in ezone-managers and E-Zone-Dashboard; each repo runs it against its own implementation (Managers public/discharge-alerts.js, Dashboard lib/discharge-alerts.js). Change both repos together. states (15 Oct 2026): an expectedDischarge marked none («אין צפי לשחרור») is never an alert and never counted as no-date.",
  "ALERT_LEAD_DAYS": 14,
  "TIME_ZONE": "Asia/Jerusalem",
